{"id":"infantil","lemma":"infantil","pos":"adj","rank":2363,"glosses":["childish; childlike","immature","of, relating, or for children."],"ipa":"/infanˈtil/","forms":{"femininePlural":"infantiles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Haylli-infantil.wav","examples":[{"text":"No seas tan infantil.","en":"Don't be so childish.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/40265","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"so, as"},null]},{"text":"Tenemos muchos libros infantiles en la biblioteca.","en":"We have a lot of children's books in the library.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/585723","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},{"g":"book","l":"libro"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"library"}]},{"text":"Ella habló de manera infantil.","en":"She talked childishly.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to talk","l":"hablar"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"way"},null]},{"text":"Su forma de pensar es muy infantil.","en":"His way of thinking is very childish.","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"shape"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to think, ponder"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null]},{"text":"Él va al jardín infantil.","en":"He goes to kindergarten.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/78300","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"okay"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"garden"},null]}]}